    '2\\u0000Tip Pool — 多角色分配（打卡按工时）\\u0000Sakura Sushi & Ramen House - Dallas, TX 75247',
    '3\\u0000Tip Pool — Server to Busser/Runner\\u0000El Fuego Tex-Mex Grill - Plano, TX 75074',
    '4\\u0000Bar Tip Pool\\u0000Golden Dragon Chinese Kitchen - Dallas, TX 75231'
